Modifications by azixxxxx, 2026:
- Replaced the Codex app-server and broker runtime with a headless adapter for
  Google's Antigravity CLI (`agy --input-format stream-json --output-format
  stream-json`). Version 0.1.0 used Gemini CLI instead.
- Renamed the plugin, commands, agent, skills, and runtime script from Codex to
  Gemini, and removed `/codex:transfer`.
- Added a per-run tool guard, an agy PreToolUse hook passed with `--add-dir`,
  that keeps review and read-only runs read-only and blocks `git commit`,
  `git push`, edits outside the repository, and subagents in write runs, plus
  an optional agy sandbox toggle.
- Rewrote the review, adversarial review, and stop-gate prompts for Gemini and
  replaced the prompting skill with Gemini-specific guidance.
- Changed review context collection to inline diffs within a byte budget.
- Made job state writes atomic and serialized read-modify-write updates with a
  lock, so concurrent jobs, commands, and hooks no longer lose records.
- Rewrote the tests for the agy runtime.

